  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This is a macro for minimizing recoil

Character: Martelu

Gun: Martelu gun (basic gun)

Skill being used: Faro skill that increases recoil by 40% be sure to equip that skill when using this macro.



Mouse DPI: 2400

Caliber sens: 10+-

Vertical sync: disabled

Screen resolution being used: 1600x1024



Have fun.


If you want me to make a macro for your character, dpi, sens, screen resolution. feel free to msg me via keyran. maybe ill make it if i got that character.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
